Mon Jun 16 05:19:02 UTC 2025 - Dead Mozay <dead_mozay@opensuse.org>

- Update to version 2.2:
  * Fix overwriting permissions on xdg-runtime-dir.
  * Fix free space percentage calculations.
  * Fix a regression that blocked restoring when booted from an ISO.
  * Replace the mount library call with the mount command to avoid 
    corrupting lsblk output.
  * Fix issues when DISPLAY is not set. 

